Raylib Minesweeper by Andrew Hamel (2022), upstream commit
 d5f81cc2a700411beca73216c819050223235d5c, under the MIT license.
The upstream repository's MIT license accompanies main.c and resources/flag.png;
no separate asset license is declared. The PNG is shipped unchanged. Unused WAV
files and the upstream Makefile are not distributed.

Pyxis changes select the delegated app:// texture, cap drawing at 60 FPS,
report display/texture initialization failure and release the texture on exit.
Game rules are unchanged. The executable statically links raylib/rlsw and SDL2;
the public package also carries their complete license notices.
